DATA
The files in site/data/ and the case text quoted in results/, docs/ and the
write-ups are derived from the Shopping Queries Dataset (ESCI):

    https://github.com/amazon-science/esci-data
    revision 7916cdf6ab75a462e77f20ab40428a10923998d5
    Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. All Rights Reserved.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The upstream LICENSE and NOTICE are reproduced unmodified in
third_party/esci-data/.

Changes made to the data: only the US-English Task 1 subset is used; the
bundle holds a 480-query sample of the official test split with each query's
judged products; examples were joined to products on locale and product ID;
HTML tags were stripped from listing text and long text was truncated;
model scores, BM25 scores, feature values and ranks were added.

Citation:
    Reddy, Màrquez, Valero, Rao, Zaragoza, Bandyopadhyay, Biswas, Xing,
    Subbian. "Shopping Queries Dataset: A Large-Scale ESCI Benchmark for
    Improving Product Search." 2022. arXiv:2206.06588.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Amazon. Product titles,
brand names and product IDs appear as they do in the dataset and belong to
their respective owners. No product photos are used.

